# Invariants

Rules that must **never** be broken. Written as commands, numbered so they can be
cited (e.g. "violates INV-002"). If code conflicts with an invariant, the code is
wrong — do not weaken the rule to match the code. If a rule genuinely must change,
do it through an ADR, then update this file.

